  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Fatures\n* SteamIdConverter Class, convert and take in any SteamID variant to convert to others\n* ConsoleService now offers ExecuteCfgFile, GetCurrentMap, GetPing, GetCvarValue\n* SteamService now offers GetLocalUsername\n* New log reader via the IPC log file, under IPC/IPCLogger class, check documentation for info\n* Crosshair code generator / reader\n\n## Fixes\n* Fixes bug in Cs2DemoDownloader causing decompression to fail\n* Fixed GSIListener from not using existing config\n* Fixed some objects be missclasses as public/private instead of internal\n* Fixed Cs2Parser from failing to determine winner\n* Fixed Cs2Parser being unable to get player object\n\n## Changes\n* Adjust how Cs2DemoDownlader stores its temp downloads\n* Adjusts demo downloading to detect if its a .bz2 before continuing \n* Changed ChatService to be IAsyncDisposable\n* Changed ChatService to use underlying ConsoleService for easier upkeep\n* Moved any console based logic to the ConsoleService class\n* Streamlined the way the virtual key is detected\n* Streamlined console execution and parallel issues",
